      "$type": "Makeree.Model.Responses.LessonStepTipTextDataDto, Makeree.Model",
      "text": "The music player transmits constantly changing electrical signals through the PL cable to the magnet wire, temporarily turning it into an electromagnet. The electromagnet vibrates back and forth, attracted and repelled rapidly from the permanent magnet. Since the wire is glued to the masking tape, this causes the tape to move back and forth as well, generating air waves which are translated with our ears (and by our brain) into sound."
